  "description": "The boss confesses his love, proposing a relationship with marriage in mind. Seo Woo, who has secretly loved him, feels her heart drop. Could the boss possibly be insane?\n\n‘As long as Eun Seo Woo doesn’t leave me, we will never break up,’ he declares.\n\nHis relentless pursuit begins, hiding his true intentions, and day by day, Seo Woo’s life is filled with thrilling excitement. Eventually, Seo Woo discovers his secret.\n\n‘So, you’ve been using me all this time, boss?’\n\nThe man, who was once arrogantly confident, now crumbles with regret before her, who has turned cold. The exhilarating taste of a reversal in their relationship unfolds.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=812144), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=9860822)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[French](https://www.webtoons.com/fr/romance/mon-boss-le-fou/list?title_no=5887), [Japanese](https://manga.line.me/product/periodic?id=Z0003490)",
